      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How terrible will be the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s judgement on those rulers who destroy and scatter his people! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, says about the rulers who were supposed to take care of his people: “You have not taken care of my people; you have scattered them and driven them away. Now I am going to punish you for the evil you have done. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will gather the rest of my people from the countries where I have scattered them, and I will bring them back to their homeland. They will have many children and increase in number. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will appoint rulers to take care of them. My people will no longer be afraid or terrified, and I will not punish them again.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23.4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "I will not punish them again",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "not one of them will be missing.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have spoken.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
